        <mxCell id="p5-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:20px&#39;&gt;5. Booking Amendments: Ownership Transfer, Unit Transfer, Cancellation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#39;font-size:11px&#39;&gt;Sources: 15 Jul, 16 Sep, 17 Sep 2026. Can occur at any point during the booking. Ownership transfer and cancellation request exist in asset; unit transfer and refund logic not implemented.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
